  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">此資源包適用於熱門模組「冰與火之龍：全新視角」！</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">本資源包旨在為該模組的貼圖帶來更新的外觀，同時保留《我的世界》原版及該模組本身的經典風格。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/307316850952241162/828727843299000370/firedragonflying.png\" alt=\"Fire Dragon retextured\" width=\"654\" height=\"568\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">您不得重新發布或修改這些貼圖。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">感謝 Dohaerys 贈送我巨怪獠牙、龍血和龍角的精靈圖檔。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
